[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あいつを！\u3000あの声の主を倒さねば……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I have to defeat it! I have to defeat the one monster with that vocalization...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はああああっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hyaaaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take that!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ああ……悪い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah... Sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "南側の海岸線全面で魔物が出現している！\n街の防御を固めろ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monsters are appearing all along the southern coastline! Fortify the town's defenses!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Warrior A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたたち、ランターナの！？\nそっちは大丈夫か！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're from Lantarna!? Are you alright over there!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Warrior B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000大丈夫です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! We're fine!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ではそちらは任せる！\u3000我々は向こうへ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then we'll leave this to you! We're heading over there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Warrior A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000そちらの男は？\u3000こんな夜に何を……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? And who's this man? What are you doing out here at this hour..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Warrior B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "道に迷っていたみたいだ！\n俺たちが送り届けよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He got lost! We'll see him home safely!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かった。では達者で！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Understood. Stay safe!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "聖戦士Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sacred Warrior B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いいのか？\u3000俺を突き出さないで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Why? Why didn't you turn me in?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティム……俺にはこの男の気持ちが分かる。\n分かってしまう。痛いほどにな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim... I understand how this man feels. I understand it all too well. Painfully so."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺は、お前を救うためにどんなことだってした。\n指名手配されるようなことも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I did everything I could to save you. Even things that got me branded a wanted man."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ティムは、あの時の俺のことを、\n今なら止めたいと思うか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Knowing what you know now, would you have tried to stop me back then?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……思わないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...No, I wouldn't."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄さんは、いつだってかっこよかった。\n僕を助けてくれた英雄だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were always my hero. You saved me when no one else could."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "他の誰がそうじゃないって言ったとしても。\n僕は兄さんを信じてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if everyone else said otherwise, I believe in you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……きっと、あの娘さんも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm sure his daughter feels the same way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……漁師さん。僕たちも手伝います",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We'll help you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの娘が信じている英雄を、\n無くすわけにはいかないからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can't let that girl lose the hero she believes in."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "情けねえ……娘のためだったらなんだってできるって\n思ってたのに、いざ魔物が出てきたら足が震えてやがる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is pathetic... I thought I could do anything for my daughter's sake, but now that the monster's here, my legs won't stop shaking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんな俺を、英雄だなんて言ってくれるのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you still call me a hero?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "英雄は強さだけじゃないと僕は思うんです。\nそれに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't think being a hero is just about strength. Besides..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待っているほうの身からしたら、\n無事に帰ってきてくれるのが一番嬉しいんですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you're the one waiting for someone to come home, what makes you happiest is knowing they made it back safely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一人で無茶しようとしないで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So don't try to do this alone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺たちが助太刀する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll fight alongside you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……本当に、ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you. Truly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "漁師",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fisherman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キー！\u3000キー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kee! Kee!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この声……こいつが例の魔物だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That cry... This must be the monster."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジェロン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geron"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やろう、兄さん。あの娘さんのためにも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do this! For his daughter!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ティム",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tim"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]